   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender equality</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In late 2024, Kiribati Women and Children Support Centre (KWCSC) partnered with the Ministry of Education to train Gender Equality Advocates (GEAs) in junior secondary schools across five outer islands. These youth leaders were equipped with psycho-social first aid skills and gender-based violence prevention knowledge to support peers experiencing bullying, abuse, or other risks. The program introduced key concepts using locally relevant examples and aimed to shift social norms at an early age. The initiative is contributing to early prevention of violence, promoting respectful relationships, and building leadership skills among students&#x2014;particularly young women&#x2014;who are now active voices for change in their schools and communities.</narrative>
    </description>
